                <syl /><neume facs="#m-7b167891-85fc-4228-813e-8aa69ea14f3c" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b18d3b29-ad5c-4e42-8f84-77fa49938c77">
                  <nc xml:id="m-94ca2237-6d61-4e06-b8c5-be203c83fae3" pname="d" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-ce3e0503-d58d-4043-a3a0-fe286f277868" facs="#m-199e2fcb-06e6-4a46-a493-100fdd8c760f" pname="e" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-5356d0ce-c13a-4009-9fee-879614b6382b"><lg xml:id="m-8f5f7d6b-921a-4c6d-b637-93b1e4ef86c9"><l xml:id="m-895f1221-9afa-4fb2-86e1-c9c39c2d4f3c" facs="#m-e4fd4f86-aeff-45b2-b23a-f2f118b103cc" label="text-like">Chants</l><l xml:id="m-8197c952-9aa3-4d2a-8467-d0c7135a0109" facs="#m-4d61deac-6df9-43c0-bc93-35496b4d10bf" label="text-like">at Benediction of the Blessed Sacrament.</l><l xml:id="m-eb2d7585-2949-402e-8719-8abe1fec1abb" facs="#m-c93c0f9d-e420-49c4-b14e-83c9b4c5cb44" label="ambiguous">m</l><l xml:id="m-6e15d434-2d53-427d-ba7f-912a8b74a92a" facs="#m-e97870cc-a3b8-4cdd-b4ba-f87b0055f8b8" label="text-like">BEFORE THE BLESSING.</l><l xml:id="m-2db66d0e-8046-4b23-8f6a-d30799e1d225" facs="#m-9548ec13-0971-47e1-85ac-dadcf7ca1033" label="ambiguous">Tantum ergo</l><l xml:id="m-8562f53f-35dc-4307-ad05-1a8b40f5056b" facs="#m-13003cb0-6b62-479e-8d8c-f5e179c63c10" label="ambiguous">1. Tantum ergo. (Pange lingua), 954. — 2. Tantum. Another Chant, 952t.</l><l xml:id="m-8f262684-85eb-4bdf-b81d-312d94bfebbc" facs="#m-e4e81673-5c01-4f11-a041-bdccde18e8a6" label="ambiguous">3. Modern Chant.</l><l xml:id="m-6d9fc529-3d75-43d3-a982-8ea71cd96312" facs="#m-03fd645f-b7d3-4b45-acaf-644d76e3443f" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-313e4ffb-d5e0-451c-a2ff-0d5e495b7e21" facs="#m-5d048640-627b-4cb7-ae8a-e6fc525e9b67" label="lyrics-like">Antum ergo Sacraméntum Vene-rémur cér-nu-i:</l><l xml:id="m-54789723-c081-4bdc-a2ba-f918c63ea66e" facs="#m-09c40b17-7465-40e7-a3dc-8bae9587c816" label="lyrics-like">Et antíquum documéntum Nóvo cédat ri-tu-i: Praéstet</l><l xml:id="m-279cc9ec-79bd-40e9-a81e-40d40e6c8133" facs="#m-cde18434-2428-435b-abae-b539b27fb1b8" label="lyrics-like">fídes suppleméntum Sénsu-um de-féctu-i.</l><l xml:id="m-7d68ff29-8b6e-496d-b4c9-6a22c968c4cc" facs="#m-be0caa4e-18be-44bb-904a-7064134ff4e3" label="lyrics-like">2. Geni-tó-ri, Geni-tóque Laus et ju-bi-lá-ti-S-lus,</l><l xml:id="m-e45c834f-2047-4952-8492-0c148312d5d4" facs="#m-bdaaa86f-1585-43c0-8071-9b7b3dcf3e1b" label="lyrics-like">hónor, vírtus quoque Sit et benedí-cti-o: Procedénti ab</l><l xml:id="m-6238cd88-e647-4b68-80aa-44c979235352" facs="#m-2151a424-2d52-4f97-9159-c591277564a4" label="text-like">A certain number of Chants that can be used at Benediction occur in the body of the</l><l xml:id="m-224a5aca-833e-4b6a-b813-f6f5d3eb24fe" facs="#m-f5ba2cec-91d8-404b-a143-9e1d09cd9c17" label="text-like">"iiber usualis". This final section contains several others that are commonly employed.</l><l xml:id="m-dfe14b02-da5e-4c1e-9ada-48efa72936cc" facs="#m-eb010f37-da64-45ca-a9a7-6bbb37e4da4b" label="text-like">Any one of them all can readily be found by referring to the Table on p. 93".</l><l xml:id="m-758ef01a-e8f9-4f4b-ba0a-6c0e949c9a5d" facs="#m-74cc40ed-7553-43bc-94e6-5141a05309b7" label="text-like">For the use of Communities and Parishes that wish for a wider choice ot pieces, a Supplement</l><l xml:id="m-72665ef1-0acd-4bcb-ba09-9daa55a0323e" facs="#m-22f1ede3-a00c-428a-8fc0-890ab6d8a9d4" label="text-like">to this book has been published, Ne 812. Completely revised in 1949, it contains in its oo paze¬</l><l xml:id="m-245b8d7e-a242-43aa-b259-aa20be10523b" facs="#m-39a418a0-c36a-4d04-96f3-67d3b04703a0" label="lyrics-like">more than 7o pieces, none of them included in the present volume, with which it can be bound ũp¬</l><l xml:id="m-2a805a17-600a-4816-b7d0-2e08ee8ebc51" facs="#m-4cf1857c-e8d7-4119-8ba0-5b2da3442e13" label="text-like">Finally ibere exists, in the same format, a very full collection of pieces for Benediction.</l><l xml:id="m-cf7182a7-2689-4e91-8f20-c2d7e68c63bb" facs="#m-bb44201c-20b7-4c35-9a0c-b803a55d245f" label="lyrics-like">"Cantuś selecti" No Sor, of 327 pages and containingzsoChant¬ (19</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
